(2271607, 312676, 52681, '<td valign="top">I think this did a wonderful job of meeting the challenge.  At first glance, I was certain that it was some type of power tool.  Then, the colors separated by wire gave it away.  Great Job.  I really like the detail and sharp focus given to the first wire.  I think the scratches and dents on the wire tell a story and give character to the well loved board. I''m curious what the dart would have looked like in the green.  I think it would give more contrast between the subject and the background (unless you were going for the silhouette look).  Good work.</td>', 'I think this did a wonderful job of meeting the challenge.  At first glance, I was certain that it was some type of power tool.  Then, the colors separated by wire gave it away.  Great Job.  I really like the detail and sharp focus given to the first wire.  I think the scratches and dents on the wire tell a story and give character to the well loved board. I''m curious what the dart would have looked like in the green.  I think it would give more contrast between the subject and the background (unless you were going for the silhouette look).  Good work.', '2006-03-29 20:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
