(2273599, 312296, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s an ok shot... but it doesn''t strike me as being particularly abstract, or even that macro, I''m afraid.</td>', 'It''s an ok shot... but it doesn''t strike me as being particularly abstract, or even that macro, I''m afraid.', '2006-03-30 14:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
