(2273607, 310426, 3102, '<td valign="top">A great nature shot to be sure, but I can''t help but feel like this was shoe-horned into the challenge a bit.  It''s not particularly abstract.</td>', 'A great nature shot to be sure, but I can''t help but feel like this was shoe-horned into the challenge a bit.  It''s not particularly abstract.', '2006-03-30 15:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
