(2273869, 311372, 43516, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how big these are in real life, but the lighting and your angle make them look huge!  I want to climb up on top of one of them.  Very nice and engaging.</td>', 'I don''t know how big these are in real life, but the lighting and your angle make them look huge!  I want to climb up on top of one of them.  Very nice and engaging.', '2006-03-30 16:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
