(2273885, 313338, 6519, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I wonder if you could have pulled that "collar" off the stem, I keep wishing it wasn''t there. I like how the upper part disappears into darkness, it works well with the subject.</td>', 'Nice idea. I wonder if you could have pulled that "collar" off the stem, I keep wishing it wasn''t there. I like how the upper part disappears into darkness, it works well with the subject.', '2006-03-30 16:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
