(2274201, 312942, 49155, '<td valign="top">I have based my voting on how the photo would look as a print on my walls (an artwork) - Love it except I would like to see most of the dark area at the top cropped, only because it distracts and gives the source away (in the context of the comp)</td>', 'I have based my voting on how the photo would look as a print on my walls (an artwork) - Love it except I would like to see most of the dark area at the top cropped, only because it distracts and gives the source away (in the context of the comp)', '2006-03-30 19:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
