(2277564, 313231, 53964, '<td valign="top">The idea is to make it abstract by taking it more closely than we normally look, not to make it too out of focus to recognise. Nice collours, but...</td>', 'The idea is to make it abstract by taking it more closely than we normally look, not to make it too out of focus to recognise. Nice collours, but...', '2006-03-31 23:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
