(2278248, 312587, 29513, '<td valign="top">Ah, a challenge within a challenge.  I like it.  Lets see. . . the inside of the left foot (unless you have reversed it) near the heel.<br/> <br/>I like the grayscale but would like to see a bit more contrast. 5.</td>', 'Ah, a challenge within a challenge.  I like it.  Lets see. . . the inside of the left foot (unless you have reversed it) near the heel. I like the grayscale but would like to see a bit more contrast. 5.', '2006-04-01 11:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
