(2278287, 313221, 53572, '<td valign="top">beautiful, but needs better focus.  is it camera shake?</td>', 'beautiful, but needs better focus.  is it camera shake?', '2006-04-01 12:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278289, 312722, 53572, '<td valign="top">lovely, but the dust is a little annoying</td>', 'lovely, but the dust is a little annoying', '2006-04-01 12:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278304, 313142, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject matter. Good choice for the challenge. I would suggest cropping out the heads and legs for more of an abstract look. Of course, you have probably been getting lots of comments about the smallness and grainy quality of the image file. It looks like maybe your camera doesn''t have a macro function and you had to crop this from a much bigger image. Nice effort,  if not a great entry.</td>', 'Very interesting subject matter. Good choice for the challenge. I would suggest cropping out the heads and legs for more of an abstract look. Of course, you have probably been getting lots of comments about the smallness and grainy quality of the image file. It looks like maybe your camera doesn''t have a macro function and you had to crop this from a much bigger image. Nice effort,  if not a great entry.', '2006-04-01 12:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278306, 313332, 7322, '<td valign="top">It looks like a fly. Nice cropping for interest. I needs much better focus and it is a bit too contrasty (although the I like the blown-out background).</td>', 'It looks like a fly. Nice cropping for interest. I needs much better focus and it is a bit too contrasty (although the I like the blown-out background).', '2006-04-01 12:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278308, 313170, 7322, '<td valign="top">this needs to be lit better to really get a sense of the texture of the gravel (sidelighting is the key to enhancing texture). This looks a bit overexposed. The focus should be sharp on the entire image (so for a macro you need to point the camera straight down) to really get the graphic abstract quality of the gravel.</td>', 'this needs to be lit better to really get a sense of the texture of the gravel (sidelighting is the key to enhancing texture). This looks a bit overexposed. The focus should be sharp on the entire image (so for a macro you need to point the camera straight down) to really get the graphic abstract quality of the gravel.', '2006-04-01 12:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278311, 313139, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter .Nice effort. I think it needs greater detail in the shadow area.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter .Nice effort. I think it needs greater detail in the shadow area.', '2006-04-01 12:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278312, 313261, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice image quality. Simple and elegant. One of the handful of really nice images I''ve seen in this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice image quality. Simple and elegant. One of the handful of really nice images I''ve seen in this challenge.', '2006-04-01 12:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278318, 313251, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and textures. I like the inclusion of the rivit to the right of the picture plane. I kind of wish the blue portion was a bit darker. I would have sacrificed a little bit of detail in the darker portions to get a really good exposure on the blue portion. Darkening the midtones with your levels adjustment (assuming you have something like that in your software) would accomplish similar results). I wonder how this would look rotated 90 degrees clockwise?</td>', 'Nice colors and textures. I like the inclusion of the rivit to the right of the picture plane. I kind of wish the blue portion was a bit darker. I would have sacrificed a little bit of detail in the darker portions to get a really good exposure on the blue portion. Darkening the midtones with your levels adjustment (assuming you have something like that in your software) would accomplish similar results). I wonder how this would look rotated 90 degrees clockwise?', '2006-04-01 12:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278319, 312775, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more detail in the texture since that is what is most interesting about this image.</td>', 'I''d like to see more detail in the texture since that is what is most interesting about this image.', '2006-04-01 12:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278322, 313222, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very unusual take on this challenge. I like the deep black of the background. I think I would like this better rotated 90 degrees counter-clockwise. The negative space created by the background resolves itself into a more pleasing design to my eye.</td>', 'Very unusual take on this challenge. I like the deep black of the background. I think I would like this better rotated 90 degrees counter-clockwise. The negative space created by the background resolves itself into a more pleasing design to my eye.', '2006-04-01 12:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278323, 312296, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t an asbtraction. It is a still-life.</td>', 'This isn''t an asbtraction. It is a still-life.', '2006-04-01 12:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278328, 312855, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I like the color and texture. I like the cropping you chose except maybe you could have cropped about an inch off the top to close up some of the negative space created by the blurred purple.</td>', 'Very interesting. I like the color and texture. I like the cropping you chose except maybe you could have cropped about an inch off the top to close up some of the negative space created by the blurred purple.', '2006-04-01 12:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278329, 313310, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice dynamic lines and shapes. Good eye for the graphic quality of the image.</td>', 'Nice dynamic lines and shapes. Good eye for the graphic quality of the image.', '2006-04-01 12:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278335, 312498, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very interesting cropping. It breaks this image into a pleasing series of curves. I feel like the spots on the banana kind of interupt that. I think this would be better with a less ripe banana and in black and white to really break it down into shapes and tones. The color sort of spoils the effect for me.</td>', 'Very interesting cropping. It breaks this image into a pleasing series of curves. I feel like the spots on the banana kind of interupt that. I think this would be better with a less ripe banana and in black and white to really break it down into shapes and tones. The color sort of spoils the effect for me.', '2006-04-01 12:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278341, 311578, 55414, '<td valign="top">Center of the bolt probobly should be more in focus</td>', 'Center of the bolt probobly should be more in focus', '2006-04-01 12:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278343, 313303, 7322, '<td valign="top">Don''t they have the most velvety muzzles? (Not sure if that''s the anatomical term). <br/> <br/>I think you could have moved in even closer (assuming your friend would not be inclined to investigate your lens). The white blaze is a bit overexposed. This is a subject worth expoloring for the textures challenge if you can get close enough to get a really sharp exposure of the fine hairs and bristly whiskers. Nice effort and amusing break.</td>', 'Don''t they have the most velvety muzzles? (Not sure if that''s the anatomical term).  I think you could have moved in even closer (assuming your friend would not be inclined to investigate your lens). The white blaze is a bit overexposed. This is a subject worth expoloring for the textures challenge if you can get close enough to get a really sharp exposure of the fine hairs and bristly whiskers. Nice effort and amusing break.', '2006-04-01 12:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278345, 312763, 7322, '<td valign="top">Lovely form and beautiful color. Really well done.</td>', 'Lovely form and beautiful color. Really well done.', '2006-04-01 12:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278348, 312907, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject matter. It''s not really focused sharp enough for my taste.</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject matter. It''s not really focused sharp enough for my taste.', '2006-04-01 12:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278355, 313284, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of form and the lighting is very dramatic. I would like to see the exposure upped by maybe one stop.I would like to see more contrast between the red and yellow streaks in the midtones, a bit more detail in the lower left corner of the image and the highlights could be a teeny bit lighter at the top.</td>', 'Very nice use of form and the lighting is very dramatic. I would like to see the exposure upped by maybe one stop.I would like to see more contrast between the red and yellow streaks in the midtones, a bit more detail in the lower left corner of the image and the highlights could be a teeny bit lighter at the top.', '2006-04-01 12:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278357, 312480, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice color and form but it could be sharper. Also, the image is a bit too small.</td>', 'Nice color and form but it could be sharper. Also, the image is a bit too small.', '2006-04-01 12:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278361, 310399, 55414, '<td valign="top">The center is out of focus.  Would be a better picture if it were in.</td>', 'The center is out of focus.  Would be a better picture if it were in.', '2006-04-01 12:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278363, 313090, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the image quality is very good. I''m not crazy about the sepia tone (unless this is an orange feather?) Now that I see the title, I''m thinking this is the color of the feather. On my monitor it looks more sepia than gold. I''m thinking this would have been a good choice for black and white, making it a study in line, shape, and tones.</td>', 'I like the subject and the image quality is very good. I''m not crazy about the sepia tone (unless this is an orange feather?) Now that I see the title, I''m thinking this is the color of the feather. On my monitor it looks more sepia than gold. I''m thinking this would have been a good choice for black and white, making it a study in line, shape, and tones.', '2006-04-01 12:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278369, 310598, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice color and texture. I think you could have cropped out the white parts.</td>', 'Nice color and texture. I think you could have cropped out the white parts.', '2006-04-01 12:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278370, 310847, 7322, '<td valign="top">A little too much glare on the plastic. It looks like it was lit from above. I would light something like this from the side to bring out the texture of bubble wrap.</td>', 'A little too much glare on the plastic. It looks like it was lit from above. I would light something like this from the side to bring out the texture of bubble wrap.', '2006-04-01 12:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278375, 311023, 7322, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed. There is just too much glare on the lower left.</td>', 'A bit overexposed. There is just too much glare on the lower left.', '2006-04-01 12:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278377, 313304, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think I''m seeing the photographer and flash reflected in everyone of this bearings. I would have liked this better lit from the side and without the reflections.</td>', 'I think I''m seeing the photographer and flash reflected in everyone of this bearings. I would have liked this better lit from the side and without the reflections.', '2006-04-01 12:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278378, 312394, 55414, '<td valign="top">Would have like to see more definition in this side of the pepercorns but overall great photo.</td>', 'Would have like to see more definition in this side of the pepercorns but overall great photo.', '2006-04-01 12:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278383, 311503, 7322, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Georgia O''Keefe painting. Very nice.</td>', 'Looks like a Georgia O''Keefe painting. Very nice.', '2006-04-01 12:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
