(2278889, 312480, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice.  Like the composition.  Wish it were bigger, 640 width in this case.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop (more inclusion of the yellow on the left, depending what you had to work with) and the fore pink a little softer, ''somehow'' (difficult in basic), make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Nice.  Like the composition.  Wish it were bigger, 640 width in this case.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop (more inclusion of the yellow on the left, depending what you had to work with) and the fore pink a little softer, ''somehow'' (difficult in basic), make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-01 19:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278900, 313303, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Like the concept.  A much tighter crop, also to diminish the overexposed areas as much as possible and perhaps a variation in the toning to leave more detail in, make this better in my opinion.  A more balanced composition (more centered or else off-centered) and 640 width (quality dependent) would have likely helped too.</td>', '3 - Like the concept.  A much tighter crop, also to diminish the overexposed areas as much as possible and perhaps a variation in the toning to leave more detail in, make this better in my opinion.  A more balanced composition (more centered or else off-centered) and 640 width (quality dependent) would have likely helped too.', '2006-04-01 19:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278927, 313314, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  Difficult, but a more finely tuned crop trying to eliminate any ''chops'' make this even better in my opinion.  Nice colors.</td>', '7 - Nice.  Difficult, but a more finely tuned crop trying to eliminate any ''chops'' make this even better in my opinion.  Nice colors.', '2006-04-01 19:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278940, 311386, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice colors.  Good concept.  Wish it was sharper.  Perhaps a tripod may have helped.</td>', '4 - Nice colors.  Good concept.  Wish it was sharper.  Perhaps a tripod may have helped.', '2006-04-01 20:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278942, 312544, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very nice.  Good control of the reds.  The only two ''nit-picks'' are the center starting to show (minor and may be intentional anyway) and overall balance: perhaps more finely tuned on the left (more or less included) <i>may</i> have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '9 - Very nice.  Good control of the reds.  The only two ''nit-picks'' are the center starting to show (minor and may be intentional anyway) and overall balance: perhaps more finely tuned on the left (more or less included) may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-01 20:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278953, 311977, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Just needs something to lift it more in my opinion, not sure what, perhaps added or enhanced color ''somewhere'', a slight rotate for more balance, not sure.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Just needs something to lift it more in my opinion, not sure what, perhaps added or enhanced color ''somewhere'', a slight rotate for more balance, not sure.', '2006-04-01 20:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278955, 311047, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  A slightly sharper angle, variation in cropping &amp;/or rotation may have given this a little extra in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  A slightly sharper angle, variation in cropping &/or rotation may have given this a little extra in my opinion.', '2006-04-01 20:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278957, 311654, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Unusual and good perspective.  Not sure on the frame/framing, perhaps more space ''somewhere'' may have given this a little extra.  Like the unusual ''bokeh'' effects in the background, perhaps a little too much dark blue in my opinion, which dominates too much and causes the focal point to lose impact.</td>', '7 - Unusual and good perspective.  Not sure on the frame/framing, perhaps more space ''somewhere'' may have given this a little extra.  Like the unusual ''bokeh'' effects in the background, perhaps a little too much dark blue in my opinion, which dominates too much and causes the focal point to lose impact.', '2006-04-01 20:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278961, 312552, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good concept and composition.  Needs to be bigger, 640 width in this case.</td>', '3 - Good concept and composition.  Needs to be bigger, 640 width in this case.', '2006-04-01 20:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278963, 310907, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice colors and composition.  Like the slightly elongated frame.</td>', '8 - Nice colors and composition.  Like the slightly elongated frame.', '2006-04-01 20:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278964, 310059, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this.  A little more light play and less grain, make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Like this.  A little more light play and less grain, make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-01 20:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278967, 311058, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this.  Very nice colors.  Very difficult, but ''if only'' those bubbles ''popped'' more.</td>', '8 - Like this.  Very nice colors.  Very difficult, but ''if only'' those bubbles ''popped'' more.', '2006-04-01 20:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278970, 310285, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice color and light play/bokeh effects.  ''If only'' to capture more of those effects, would have given this a little extra and made it even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice color and light play/bokeh effects.  ''If only'' to capture more of those effects, would have given this a little extra and made it even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-01 20:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278973, 312659, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Nice composition and colors.  Difficult, but ''if only'' the drop &amp;/or ''strand'' it is on were even sharper.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Nice composition and colors.  Difficult, but ''if only'' the drop &/or ''strand'' it is on were even sharper.', '2006-04-01 20:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
