(2278982, 310715, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very good.  Colors, textures and composition all very good.  The only ''nit-pick'' would be the blue reflection, but fairly minor.  Even more definition and clarity - but that is likely lens dependent.  Might sound ''minor'', but for such a good shot, wish there was no ''typo'' in the title. <i>edit:typo</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-05 06:09:50.</i></td>', '9 - Very good.  Colors, textures and composition all very good.  The only ''nit-pick'' would be the blue reflection, but fairly minor.  Even more definition and clarity - but that is likely lens dependent.  Might sound ''minor'', but for such a good shot, wish there was no ''typo'' in the title. edit:typo', '2006-04-01 20:44:12.000000', '2006-04-05 07:09:50.000000', 1),
