(2278988, 312550, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Nice simple colors.  Sharper with the green make this even better in my opinion, but difficult I know.  Good concept and title (without which I''d never have ''got it'').</td>', '8 - Very good.  Nice simple colors.  Sharper with the green make this even better in my opinion, but difficult I know.  Good concept and title (without which I''d never have ''got it'').', '2006-04-01 20:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
