(2287124, 311864, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Up from 7.  This grows on you.  Nice composition.  Perhaps just a slight tweaking of the colors to get the purples and greens a little more vivid make this even better in my opinion, although does work well as is.  Tempted to suggest more texture/sharper, but it might lose something like that, who knows.</td>', '8 - Up from 7.  This grows on you.  Nice composition.  Perhaps just a slight tweaking of the colors to get the purples and greens a little more vivid make this even better in my opinion, although does work well as is.  Tempted to suggest more texture/sharper, but it might lose something like that, who knows.', '2006-04-04 19:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2287131, 313344, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Up from 7.  Like this.  More of a square framing may have made this even better in my opinion, but your call, obviously.  Perhaps a little dark overall, but this size doesn''t help with that.  Like the detail and texture in areas of the petals and especially the clarity of the drop against the darker area behind it.</td>', '8 - Up from 7.  Like this.  More of a square framing may have made this even better in my opinion, but your call, obviously.  Perhaps a little dark overall, but this size doesn''t help with that.  Like the detail and texture in areas of the petals and especially the clarity of the drop against the darker area behind it.', '2006-04-04 19:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2287138, 313093, 55546, '<td valign="top">nice lines texture and dimension...the monochrome-type colour rendition and the white infinite background also supports this very good (but simple) composition well</td>', 'nice lines texture and dimension...the monochrome-type colour rendition and the white infinite background also supports this very good (but simple) composition well', '2006-04-04 19:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2287141, 312516, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this, including the concept.  Just needs ''something'' to lift it, in my opinion.  Perhaps a little more depth or variation in framing &amp;/or cropping, not sure.  Colors are nice, although the darker area at the fore/bottom, perhaps needs the most ''lift'' - just like to see more clarity in that ''bud'', although I realize that might counteract the abstractness, so not sure.</td>', '7 - Like this, including the concept.  Just needs ''something'' to lift it, in my opinion.  Perhaps a little more depth or variation in framing &/or cropping, not sure.  Colors are nice, although the darker area at the fore/bottom, perhaps needs the most ''lift'' - just like to see more clarity in that ''bud'', although I realize that might counteract the abstractness, so not sure.', '2006-04-04 19:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2287149, 312504, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice.  Creates a <i>slight</i> optical illusion.  A more finely tuned crop <i>may</i> have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Nice.  Creates a slight optical illusion.  A more finely tuned crop may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-04 19:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2287153, 311789, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice colors and composition.  Like the texture(s)/surfaces.  Difficult with abstracts to make suggestions.  Perhaps some of the drops sharper, who knows.</td>', '8 - Nice colors and composition.  Like the texture(s)/surfaces.  Difficult with abstracts to make suggestions.  Perhaps some of the drops sharper, who knows.', '2006-04-04 19:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2287156, 310298, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this.  Good texture(s), detail and colors.  Perhaps an even sharper angle may have given this a little extra, but this may be exactly what you were aiming for so who knows.</td>', '8 - Like this.  Good texture(s), detail and colors.  Perhaps an even sharper angle may have given this a little extra, but this may be exactly what you were aiming for so who knows.', '2006-04-04 19:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2287181, 312931, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like the concept.  More clarity make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Like the concept.  More clarity make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-04 20:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2287189, 310493, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this.  Nice colors.  Perhaps a variation in cropping/framing, depending what you had to work with of course (and what you were aiming for - which may well be exactly this), may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Like this.  Nice colors.  Perhaps a variation in cropping/framing, depending what you had to work with of course (and what you were aiming for - which may well be exactly this), may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-04 20:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2287216, 310684, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Like the colors.  Not sure on the frame.  (3rd look) - Really like the olive shimmer and the matte blackness captured, ''if only'' sharper (although I realize this size likely doesn''t do it justice) and a variation <i>perhaps</i> in the framing/composition (more at the bottom maybe), ''somewhere'', <i>may</i> have made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the blue upper right, but fairly minor and not uncomplementary anyway.  Frame ''works'', the more ''you'' look at it, but the simplicity is what I like most overall here, hence my comment on the frame.  Unique.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Like the colors.  Not sure on the frame.  (3rd look) - Really like the olive shimmer and the matte blackness captured, ''if only'' sharper (although I realize this size likely doesn''t do it justice) and a variation perhaps in the framing/composition (more at the bottom maybe), ''somewhere'', may have made this even better in my opinion.  Not sure on the blue upper right, but fairly minor and not uncomplementary anyway.  Frame ''works'', the more ''you'' look at it, but the simplicity is what I like most overall here, hence my comment on the frame.  Unique.', '2006-04-04 20:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2287234, 310361, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very interesting depth of field work.  The black and white works well for this shot and the lighting looks good.</td>', 'Very interesting depth of field work.  The black and white works well for this shot and the lighting looks good.', '2006-04-04 20:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2287235, 313037, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the play of light on this shot.  The lighting combined with the lines of the plant makes for a really neat abstract shot.  I might prefer a touch more color, which I think would make the shadows and highlights really pop!</td>', 'I like the play of light on this shot.  The lighting combined with the lines of the plant makes for a really neat abstract shot.  I might prefer a touch more color, which I think would make the shadows and highlights really pop!', '2006-04-04 20:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
