(2287239, 313295, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Love the depth of field work here!!  The lighting is really well done and I like the composition, especially with the upper left corner showing negative space.</td>', 'Wow!  Love the depth of field work here!!  The lighting is really well done and I like the composition, especially with the upper left corner showing negative space.', '2006-04-04 20:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
