(2287268, 310271, 35513, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting!  And I like how the lower right corner is black and the upper left corner is white....very neat!</td>', 'Lovely lighting!  And I like how the lower right corner is black and the upper left corner is white....very neat!', '2006-04-04 20:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
