(2288812, 311729, 30364, '<td valign="top">Such a <i>complete</i> image, Christine.  I''ve said this before of your work, but once again you have produced a photograph that really rewards a second, third and fourth look.  You''ve done it to me several times now, so it cannot be an accident.  In the hope that one or two others who stumble across this comment might appreciate the work of an original and cerebral photographer who eschews "pretty" dross and instead asks the viewer to make an effort, here''s a few links to follow:<br/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=300603" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/455/thumb/300603.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/455/thumb/300603.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/455/thumb/300603.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=274654" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/430/thumb/274654.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/430/thumb/274654.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/430/thumb/274654.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=244621" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42132/thumb/244621.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42132/thumb/244621.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42132/thumb/244621.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=235312" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42132/thumb/235312.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42132/thumb/235312.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42132/thumb/235312.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Such a complete image, Christine.  I''ve said this before of your work, but once again you have produced a photograph that really rewards a second, third and fourth look.  You''ve done it to me several times now, so it cannot be an accident.  In the hope that one or two others who stumble across this comment might appreciate the work of an original and cerebral photographer who eschews "pretty" dross and instead asks the viewer to make an effort, here''s a few links to follow:    ', '2006-04-05 07:30:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2288917, 311640, 36521, '<td valign="top">My highest finish so far (",) I''ve finally surpassed the score of 6.0 (",) I had second thoughts in submitting this at first, because some might say "it''s not abstract" or something like "ahh the bubbles challenge" or some might just vote it down without stating the reasons. (",) Well, anyway I''m really glad I pushed through with this one.  Thanks to all your votes and helpful comments...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-05 07:42:34.</i></td>', 'My highest finish so far (",) I''ve finally surpassed the score of 6.0 (",) I had second thoughts in submitting this at first, because some might say "it''s not abstract" or something like "ahh the bubbles challenge" or some might just vote it down without stating the reasons. (",) Well, anyway I''m really glad I pushed through with this one.  Thanks to all your votes and helpful comments...', '2006-04-05 08:15:08.000000', '2006-04-05 08:42:34.000000', 0),
