(2289199, 310672, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Freud tablesaw blade.  ;^)  Have to be a woodworker to know that kerf.  Great idea!  It should do well. 9 </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Well, it was Freud anyway wasn''t it?  If not a tablesaw blade.  ;^)</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Freud tablesaw blade.  ;^)  Have to be a woodworker to know that kerf.  Great idea!  It should do well. 9  Well, it was Freud anyway wasn''t it?  If not a tablesaw blade.  ;^)', '2006-04-05 10:31:36.000000', NULL, 0),
