(2289587, 311510, 35751, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 20 finish!!  You''ve improved by leaps and bounds since you''ve come back the past few months...keep it up because you have some great work...of course I know that but I think everyone here at DPC needs to see it as well.....I''m proud of you! love ya!!</td>', 'Congrats on your top 20 finish!!  You''ve improved by leaps and bounds since you''ve come back the past few months...keep it up because you have some great work...of course I know that but I think everyone here at DPC needs to see it as well.....I''m proud of you! love ya!!', '2006-04-05 13:21:30.000000', NULL, 0),
