(2289925, 312573, 40320, '<td valign="top">I knew this photo would fall in the middle of the voting and that''s perfectly fine.  I still wanted to share it with those that might want to take a longer look.  Do you see the birds?  The human figures floating, rising and dipping? The lover''s embrace? The serpents amongst the mist?  The longer you look the more images appear.  Enjoy</td>', 'I knew this photo would fall in the middle of the voting and that''s perfectly fine.  I still wanted to share it with those that might want to take a longer look.  Do you see the birds?  The human figures floating, rising and dipping? The lover''s embrace? The serpents amongst the mist?  The longer you look the more images appear.  Enjoy', '2006-04-05 15:49:04.000000', NULL, 0),
