(2291928, 313231, 30208, '<td valign="top">Well thanks to everyone for the comments.  I knew it would probably not get the best rating.  As the week went on I thought about it and think it would have done better as an abstract "art" picutre and probably isn''t best suited for a contest in photography.<br/> <br/>The other thing that didn''t help is the thumbnail view.  It looks better the larger the picture is.<br/> <br/>On to the next challenge...</td>', 'Well thanks to everyone for the comments.  I knew it would probably not get the best rating.  As the week went on I thought about it and think it would have done better as an abstract "art" picutre and probably isn''t best suited for a contest in photography. The other thing that didn''t help is the thumbnail view.  It looks better the larger the picture is. On to the next challenge...', '2006-04-06 12:15:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2291970, 313142, 33505, '<td valign="top">Wow, i totally missed that it was a bug. Guess you did a good job making it unrecognizable at first glance! I would have marked this one higher had I known it was a bug. I just thought you were taking a picture of a mask.  :-)</td>', 'Wow, i totally missed that it was a bug. Guess you did a good job making it unrecognizable at first glance! I would have marked this one higher had I known it was a bug. I just thought you were taking a picture of a mask.  :-)', '2006-04-06 12:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2291979, 310715, 3306, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tom_Robbrecht:</b></div><hr/><i> Fantastic macro shot !<br/>Which lens was used ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Tom,<br/>  I was about 4 ft away and I used an EF 24-70mm 1:2.8 lens with flash. I wish I could have cloned out the burnout from the flash but challenge rules did not allow.</td>', 'Originally posted by Tom_Robbrecht: Fantastic macro shot !Which lens was used ?   Thanks Tom,  I was about 4 ft away and I used an EF 24-70mm 1:2.8 lens with flash. I wish I could have cloned out the burnout from the flash but challenge rules did not allow.', '2006-04-06 12:44:35.000000', NULL, 0),
