(2300956, 312749, 49155, '<td valign="top">I made a comment on the second placegetter, something like "I know this photo did not show up when I was doing my voting" and the same goes for you photo, else I would have given it a vote. Thirdplacegetters did show up though, and I did vote for it. Anyway great shot, you should be proud of yourself, well done.</td>', 'I made a comment on the second placegetter, something like "I know this photo did not show up when I was doing my voting" and the same goes for you photo, else I would have given it a vote. Thirdplacegetters did show up though, and I did vote for it. Anyway great shot, you should be proud of yourself, well done.', '2006-04-10 04:46:31.000000', NULL, 0),
