(2328670, 313032, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6.  Really liked it, but for this Challenge, wasn''t abstract ''enough'' for me.  Instantly identifiable plumage - very nice.  Also, difficult for abstracts, but more definition in the feathers (and given what I said above), perhaps a tighter crop (quality dependent of course) may have made this even better in my opinion.  Tweaking of the colors too, but likely difficult.</td>', 'I gave this a 6.  Really liked it, but for this Challenge, wasn''t abstract ''enough'' for me.  Instantly identifiable plumage - very nice.  Also, difficult for abstracts, but more definition in the feathers (and given what I said above), perhaps a tighter crop (quality dependent of course) may have made this even better in my opinion.  Tweaking of the colors too, but likely difficult.', '2006-04-20 06:56:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2329664, 313316, 37103, '<td valign="top">sorry you only got one comment, that seems to be the way it goes sometimes.  <br/> <br/>I also like the watery/liquid element to this photo.  I''m not sure I like the vertical orientation and since the subject is abstract I don''t think you''d lose anything by turning it 90 degrees in either direction (whichever you like more).  The color is nice, but I might like it more slightly lighter.  Really interesting forms and lines.</td>', 'sorry you only got one comment, that seems to be the way it goes sometimes.   I also like the watery/liquid element to this photo.  I''m not sure I like the vertical orientation and since the subject is abstract I don''t think you''d lose anything by turning it 90 degrees in either direction (whichever you like more).  The color is nice, but I might like it more slightly lighter.  Really interesting forms and lines.', '2006-04-20 15:10:09.000000', NULL, 0),
