(2390970, 312945, 54540, '<td valign="top">I didn''t realize this was yours during the macro challenge - I stumbled across it this weekend.<br/> <br/>A weekend or two ago, I decided to shoot similar, and became captivated with the colors.  We have a version of such a thermometer, and I decided to lay it horizontally in the grass.  The colors are so rich inside.<br/> <br/>Altbough an odd angle, one of my favorite images for the color:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=328161" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/54540/thumb/328161.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/54540/thumb/328161.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/54540/thumb/328161.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Cheers &amp; Tschuess!</td>', 'I didn''t realize this was yours during the macro challenge - I stumbled across it this weekend. A weekend or two ago, I decided to shoot similar, and became captivated with the colors.  We have a version of such a thermometer, and I decided to lay it horizontally in the grass.  The colors are so rich inside. Altbough an odd angle, one of my favorite images for the color:  Cheers & Tschuess!', '2006-05-07 21:41:14.000000', NULL, 0),
