(2805740, 311503, 9285, '<td valign="top">A really elegant shot.. :)<br/>If I could change 1 thing... it''ll be to have it sharper..<br/>This shot looks like it''s been stretched from a smaller image..</td>', 'A really elegant shot.. :)If I could change 1 thing... it''ll be to have it sharper..This shot looks like it''s been stretched from a smaller image..', '2006-09-06 14:27:48.000000', NULL, 0),
