(3225700, 312813, 60183, '<td valign="top">wowww<br/>i can''t believe this got a 4.8, i really like it a lot.  not sure why it did so poorly actually.  great texture!</td>', 'wowwwi can''t believe this got a 4.8, i really like it a lot.  not sure why it did so poorly actually.  great texture!', '2007-01-13 12:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3469539, 313316, 30982, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t even look like a photograph - and I don''t mean that in a bad way.  Has a watercolor/painted look to it.  Richness of color is excellent.  Might be cool as one of those tryptichs in different hues, too.</td>', 'This doesn''t even look like a photograph - and I don''t mean that in a bad way.  Has a watercolor/painted look to it.  Richness of color is excellent.  Might be cool as one of those tryptichs in different hues, too.', '2007-03-18 06:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3635744, 312749, 74952, '<td valign="top">This just proves as time and time again, it''s not the equipment but the photographer that matters most.</td>', 'This just proves as time and time again, it''s not the equipment but the photographer that matters most.', '2007-05-10 01:21:25.000000', NULL, 0),
